{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0A1T", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$H : \\mathcal{I} \\to \\mathcal{J}$", "MATH_0003": "$H$", "MATH_0004": "$M : \\mathcal{J} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$M \\circ H$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-initial-essentially-constant}\n", "suffix": "\n\\end{lemma}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:17b2def93ba331de0ef5dd549773d69b99fd611bcc5f67c28e5f0cf7b0d933d8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fa614ca5121804dce1a40faf42acbd81479279effbb4ec745738956061b150be", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a functor of cofiltered index categories. If <MATH_0003> is initial, then\nany diagram <MATH_0004> is essentially constant\nif and only if <MATH_0005> is essentially constant.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6bc501ee40a63e56bccd741bc89404c5c19c67d77cdf3cda2a3fed4a568f0143", "unit_id": "tag:0A1T:statement"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0A1T", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{J}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{I}^{opp}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{J}^{opp}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-essentially-constant-pro}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-initial}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-cofinal}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\n\\end{proof}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:631430fe34857e188e83e52f17942b473b7bfc994259942bbb82ed9846c693cc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7840b8b6d59e13464bafd1ee3991af4ab014aaf97c14960234f49606dee41a6f", "source_text": "This follows formally from\nLemmas <REF_0001>,\n<REF_0002>, <REF_0003>, and\nthe fact that if <MATH_0001> is initial in <MATH_0002>,\nthen <MATH_0003> is cofinal in <MATH_0004>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7bdb887443ec8d786caaa08abc3497224afab1f03e869d2cb950f9cdd5ab4b58", "unit_id": "tag:0A1T:proof-p001"}
